        9,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michigantown%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town was incorporated in the early 1870s, formalizing its status after several decades of growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
