      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michigantown%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The northern edge of Michigantown was once called Lowdenville after William Lowden added lots in the 1870s.",
